    "type": "demo",
    "description": "Join us for an informative session on the O-1 visa pathway for founders, builders, researchers, engineers, and community leaders.\n\nGuest speaker Karishma Mandal will share practical insights on building a strong O-1 profile, preparing your application, and showcasing your impact through achievements, publications, speaking opportunities, community involvement, and other forms of recognition.\n\nWhether you are exploring the O-1 path or actively preparing your application, this event will help you understand the process and connect with others on a similar journey.",
